    "content": "<p style=\"padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap; line-height: 35px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 仿宋; color: #FF0000; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 20px;\">温馨提示：</span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap; text-indent: 15px; line-height: 35px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 仿宋; color: #FF0000; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">为避免邮寄档案出现遗失，请考生本人携带密封完整且加盖公章的档案入学报到，如确不允许考生本人自带，请务必通过机要或</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">EMS特快专递方式寄送到学生就读学校所在档案接收地址。</span></span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap; line-height: 35px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap; line-height: 35px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 20px;\">收件人：广东技术师范大学学生档案室</span></p><p style=\